# Place TLS certificates here (mounted read-only into the edge container):
#   fullchain.pem   — certificate chain
#   privkey.pem     — private key
#
# For games.example.com, e.g. via certbot:
#   certbot certonly --standalone -d games.example.com
# then copy/symlink the resulting fullchain.pem and privkey.pem into this dir.
#
# This directory is git-ignored except for this file.
